    "title": "「手机端」盘点单",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<h2 id=\"%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E7%9B%98%E7%82%B9%E5%8D%95\" tabindex=\"-1\">新增盘点单<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E7%9B%98%E7%82%B9%E5%8D%95\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>路径：点击右下角【更多】-【盘点】-右下角【盘点】，选择要盘点的商品信息，然后输入实际数量保存即可。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202601/b2f65cddacc4f3749aa01d0bfb6ae134.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"%E4%BD%9C%E5%BA%9F%E7%9B%98%E7%82%B9%E5%8D%95\" tabindex=\"-1\">作废盘点单<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E4%BD%9C%E5%BA%9F%E7%9B%98%E7%82%B9%E5%8D%95\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>路径：点击进入盘点单详情界面，然后点击底部的【作废】按钮即可作废盘点单。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202601/db6150b5d1fd594ea5bb28a075162052.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>注意：盘点单做错了是不支持修改的，只能作废后重新做盘点单。</p>\n",
